      "reasons": [
        "The definition adds a broad general meaning (“the mode of reproduction an organism shows”) that is not defined for this term in the packet.",
        "The example about producing males from unfertilized eggs and females from fertilized eggs describes arrhenotoky, which the packet contrasts with thelytoky rather than defining as “reproductive type.”",
